# Privacy Policy for Harvest Rain

**Effective Date: September 27, 2026**

Thank you for playing Harvest Rain.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected and used when you use the Harvest Rain mobile application.

## 1. Information We Collect

Harvest Rain does not require you to create an account, and we do not directly collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, or other information that directly identifies you.

However, Harvest Rain uses third-party advertising services, including Google AdMob. These services may automatically collect certain information from your device in order to provide advertisements, measure their performance, prevent fraud, and maintain the advertising service.

Depending on your device, settings, location, and consent choices, this information may include:

* IP address
* Device and advertising identifiers
* General device information
* App interactions, such as app launches, taps, and ad interactions
* Diagnostic and performance information
* Approximate location derived from information such as your IP address

We do not directly receive information that identifies you personally from Google AdMob.

## 2. Information Stored on Your Device

Harvest Rain keeps a record of your play so that your scores, awards and settings are there the next time you play. This includes your best score and furthest round at each game speed, the number of games you have finished, running totals such as fruit caught, baskets harvested and power-ups used, the awards you have won and the day each was won, your sound volumes and your chosen game speed.

This information is stored only on your own device. It is not transmitted to us, it is not transmitted to any third party, and we have no access to it.

You can erase your scores and awards at any time using the RESET control on the app's settings screen. Your sound volumes and game speed are kept until you change them. Uninstalling the app erases all of it.

## 3. Advertising

Harvest Rain is supported by advertisements provided through Google AdMob.

The app shows banner advertisements on its menu and other screens. When you run out of lives, it may also offer an optional rewarded video advertisement: watching it to the end lets you continue your game. Watching a rewarded video is always your choice, and declining it simply ends the game as usual.

Depending on your location, device settings, and consent choices, advertisements may be personalized or non-personalized.

Google and its advertising partners may use device identifiers and other information to provide, measure, personalize, and improve advertising and to detect and prevent fraud.

For more information about how Google uses information from apps that use its services, please see Google's privacy information:

https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites

## 4. Internet Access

Harvest Rain requires internet access for certain features, including loading and displaying advertisements.

The core gameplay may function without an internet connection, but advertisements, including the rewarded video that lets you continue a game, may not be available while offline.

## 5. Consent and Privacy Choices

Where required by applicable law, users may be presented with a consent message that allows them to make choices regarding the use of their information for advertising purposes.

Where such a choice has been presented, it can be revisited at any time using the PRIVACY OPTIONS control on the app's settings screen.

Users may also be able to control advertising personalization and advertising identifiers through their device privacy settings.

## 6. Children's Privacy

Harvest Rain is a general-audience game.

We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.

Advertising services used by the app may process information as described in this Privacy Policy. Where required, appropriate restrictions are applied to advertising and data processing.

Parents or guardians who have questions regarding their child's privacy may contact us using the email address provided below.

## 7. Data Security

We do not operate our own servers for collecting or storing users' personal information.

Information processed by third-party services such as Google AdMob is handled according to their respective privacy and security practices.

Information transmitted by the Google Mobile Ads SDK is encrypted in transit.

## 8. Third-Party Services

Harvest Rain uses third-party services that may collect or process information according to their own privacy policies.

The primary third-party service currently used by Harvest Rain is:

**Google AdMob** — advertising, including rewarded video advertising, advertising measurement, analytics related to advertising, and fraud prevention.

Google Privacy Policy:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

Information about Google's use of data from apps using Google services:
